{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spiritstead is a cozy\u00a0life-sim town-building game where you care for a growing village full of cute little villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Start by placing houses. As you build, new villagers will appear along with the buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/Steam_Building_GIF-ezgif.com-added-text.gif?t=1744281538\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign them to farms, mills, or workshops to earn gold and keep your town running and growing. But be careful - if you work them too much, they will get tired and grumpy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__3_.gif?t=1744281538\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you make your villagers grumpy, take care of them by sending them to caf\u00e9s, bookstores, or other happiness buildings. It helps them rest and feel happy again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/Steam_Work9-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744281538\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you grow your village and unlock new levels, you\u2019ll gain access to new buildings, cute items, and fun ways to decorate your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/NEw_level_steam.gif?t=1744281538\" />Some say that if your town is just right, magical \u2728spirits\u2728 may appear. They might help your village\u2026 or just be fun to collect.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501540?t=1744281538","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3501540?t=1744281538","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/742ba711f44415793204adf8338d482a90d3af03/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744281538","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/742ba711f44415793204adf8338d482a90d3af03/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744281538","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spiritstead is a cozy\u00a0life-sim town-building game where you care for a growing village full of cute little villagers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>Start by placing houses. As you build, new villagers will appear along with the buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/Steam_Building_GIF-ezgif.com-added-text.gif?t=1744281538\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Assign them to farms, mills, or workshops to earn gold and keep your town running and growing. But be careful - if you work them too much, they will get tired and grumpy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__3_.gif?t=1744281538\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you make your villagers grumpy, take care of them by sending them to caf\u00e9s, bookstores, or other happiness buildings. It helps them rest and feel happy again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3501540/extras/Steam_Work9-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744281538\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you grow your village and unlock new levels, you\u2019ll gain access to new buildings, cute items, and fun ways to decorate your world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"ht